WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.625
When people lose weight they

00:00:01.636 --> 00:00:03.183
often lose some muscle along

00:00:03.193 --> 00:00:03.744
with fat

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.294
About 20 to 40 percent

00:00:06.304 --> 00:00:07.470
of total weight loss can

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.582
come from lean tissue

00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:11.286
Keeping muscles healthy supports your

00:00:11.296 --> 00:00:13.044
physical ability and quality of

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:13.976
life over time

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.631
Weight training helps build muscle

00:00:16.642 --> 00:00:19.100
by increasing protein synthesis especially

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:20.095
with protein intake

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:23.752
Questions Ask a Steer doctor

00:00:23.763 --> 00:00:25.077
at steerclub.com
